# Project context

Read `project.aidl` to understand the full architecture of this project.
It uses AIDL format — see `aidl-ref.md` for the symbol reference.

After reading the .aidl file you should be able to:
- Navigate the app mentally (all screens, routes, permissions)
- Know every API endpoint and its inputs/outputs
- Identify known anomalies and their causes
- Generate code consistent with the existing architecture

When you modify the project, update `project.aidl` to reflect your changes.
